<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">2 TIMOTE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool wa mviaal ola Timote</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool wa mviaal ola</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timote</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wa mviaal wu, Pool bvool oyuɔɔl ndɛ ola Timote. Ndɛ oswɛn ndɛ bvool onse bwal ke bviil li Lom (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:8">1.8</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 1:17">17</ref></char>). Ndɛ ayɛɛn m'emfa kyɛn baal ayiri ndɛ bvool wu osiil ye ndɛ kɛn Luk ndyam ɔ̃tu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:15">1.15</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:11">4.11</ref></char>). Ndɛ aluɔɔn Timote k'aya ola ndɛ tswa-a-tswa ye k'etɔ ɔ̃mvu wa mfyɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:21">4.21</ref></char>). Onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, Pool opio ɔ̃liɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi etal ɔ̃sal wu alweel Mfam.</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ɔ̃nkaan wu, ke mbee a ɔ̃bio wu abebio ŋ'abɛɛn k'aswɛn ɔ̃nkaan, Pool abveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Timote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-5">1.1-5</ref></char>). Ndɛ ayeel baal emfa ki enam ndɛ ye Timote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:6-18">1.6-18</ref></char>). Onse ebaal ki mviaal, Pool ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Yeso Mãsia, bvool atam Timote k'akal y'okuru o nzuru onse ãmpal, ndɛ asuo emfa ki akal ke nkwel a baal bɛn ola bɔ «ãtee ãluu onge b'eluu bwɔɔ li eli ye tsuɛɛn» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:1-4:8">2.1–4.8</ref></char>). Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Pool awa ɔ̃lɛɛl wɛn onse okɔ, ãwua ãbvɔɔn y'otsweel b'okiool o ndɛ bvool y'ãndɔɔ ãkyam m'etam ndɛ osa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:9-22">4.9-22</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wu, Pool amwɛn kwɛn epfu eyii tso-tsoo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:6-8">4.6-8</ref></char>), ndɛ bu ayɛɛn Timote k'akal ye mpɛn onse okiool. Ndɛ hɛ̃ ayɛɛn bibi m'epfuũ e mbiri a Ebvɔɔn, ndɛ awal emvɛɛl m'ɔ̃sal a mbwel-mbwel, me wa ɔ̃tsuu-ntiin, me wu ɔ̃sal-ãnguun ye wu a mfam a nzɔ. Ndɛ asuo kwɛn ebvaan asɛn ãnã m'oyiool o Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Yeso Mãsia me pyɛ oyi wɛ. Me nkuul a Timote, Pool ayɛɛn ye mbuul wueel wu oli ye pfuũ li abebiri Ebvɔɔn me wuaal li Ɔ̃fel wu abeluul bia-byɛ me mpɛn, me dzii bvool m'okal y'okwɛn nkal ãnzuru ã bia-byam (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:7">1.7</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ ndi ntam a Yeso Mãsia m'emfa ki edzii Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi etsal nsia a elaã li élieel Nziã ndiri awa baal onse Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan wu ola yɛ wu Timote, muaan a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃tio. Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Taal ye Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia asio yɛ nyiĩ, asa yɛ obvɛ bvool awa yɛ opi!<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obveel o Nziã ãtuɛɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Mɛ̃ ebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn wu ebesal mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ ɔ̃kwal tsɛtsɛ onge b'ési ankiɔɔn a mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ, tsia mwiĩ, mɛ̃ ebelɔ yɛ kɛn olɔ onse ãbuɛɛn ã mɛ̃. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ŋ'ebeyeel mɛ̃ elel e yɛ, mɛ̃ ndi bam ye nzal a k'emwɛn yɛ, kwɛn mɛ̃ nduul m'esɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Mɛ̃ ebesɛɛn okiool o yɛ bo taa-taa. Okiool obɔ b'óli tsɔɔn ye nkiɔɔn a yɛ wu ɔ̃kaal Loyise ye ngoo a yɛ Ehunis. Mɛ̃ nkiool bam wɛn bɔ hɛ̃ oli onse yɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwɛn fool ye mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a Nsia yi Ngesɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ ewa yɛ luo wɛn sa kwɛn kab e Nziã li onse yɛ esiool bvool ekaan onge mbaa yi afel. Kab olɔ li éyɔɔ yɛ ŋ'éndɔɔl mɛ̃ yɛ mviɔɔl. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɔ̃fel wu ewi Nziã bia-byɛ k'ali wa buɔ wɛ, ndɛ oli Ɔ̃fel wu aluul bia-byɛ me mpɛn, me dzii bvool m'okal onse onkyab. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Bee y'opfuru okal b'atsweel wɛn Yeso oli Mfam, bvool bee hɛ̃ y'opfuru okal me mɛ̃ wu ndi mbuul a bwal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. Kɛn a mwɛn fool ye mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a Nsia yi Ngesɛ me waan e Nziã. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Ndɛ wu ábvuul bia-byɛ bvool áti bia-byɛ mbel yi ngel. Ndɛ k'ási obobɔ me ndɔɔ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bia-byɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ a m'éwɛɛ ndyam bvool me ndɔɔ a nyiĩ yi ésio ndɛ bia-byɛ onse Yeso Mãsio, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ye k'ebɛɛn ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Meba, ndɛ osuo nyiĩ oyɔ ŋ'eyi Ɔ̃mvuul a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia. Ndɛ wu osi kwɛn mpɛn a epfu efa, bvool me Nsia yi Ngesɛ, osi kwɛn baal ayɛɛ elaã lɛn ntɔ pyɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Nziã osueel mɛ̃ ndyam me ndɔɔ yi etsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ oyɔ onge ntam bvool onge ɔ̃yiool. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Obɔ otsɛn b'ebemwɛn mɛ̃ ãmpal mã. Kɛn a mɛ̃ k'eyoo opfuru me mɔ̃ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wu ndɔ mɛ̃ okiool onse ndɛ. Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ nkiool bam wɛn ndɛ oli ye waan li akwɛɛ m'éwi ndɛ mɛ̃ tiil tsoo olɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Ãyɛɛn mã taa-taa m'eyɔɔ yɛ ola mɛ̃, dzuu m'emfa ki etam mɔ̃, m'okiool ye dzii onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Opfel b'awi yɛ obɔ, kwɛɛ bɔ me mpɛn a Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu oli onse yɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Yɛ yɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn, baal bueel ba nsie yi Adzi ayiri mɛ̃. Onse baal obɔ, mɛ̃ nkoo m'otsiɔ Fidzel ye Hɛɛmodzɛn. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã asio nzɔ a Onedzifɔɔl nyiĩ, ke ngwel wɛ ãlio bibi ndɛ owi mɛ̃ mpɛn, bvool ndɛ k'ayoo opfuru me ndɔɔ yi ndi mɛ̃ me bwal wɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Ŋ'eyi ndɛ Lom, ndɛ obii mɛ̃ y'efua kyam, tiil k'emwɛn ndɛ mɛ̃. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam asa kwɛn Nziã asio ndɛ nyiĩ me tsoo olɔ. Yam bam yɛɛ ngesɛ emfa ki ewueel ndɛ mɛ̃ k'Efedze.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mbwel-mbwel a Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Yɛ wu muaan a mɛ̃, oŋɔ̃ kal ye mpɛn me nyiĩ yi efa onse bvoo a bia-byɛ ye Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />M'eyio yɛ ola mɛ̃ ke nkwel a amwɛn bibi, wa mɔ̃ me baal b'abvaan m'oyiool o baal akyam mɔ̃ hɛ̃. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Mwɛn fool ye mɛ̃ onge mbwel-mbwel a Yeso Mãsia wu ɔ̃bvɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Mbwel-mbwel wu asa ɔ̃sal a ndɛ bvool odzii k'asa mfam a ndɛ esɛ, k'akɛɛ nguo m'ãndɔɔ m'omwiĩ wɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, ɔ̃tsuu-ntiin k'akoo k'abɔɔ ebva-kab e ntiin wɛ, okɛɛn ndɛ k'akieel ãngel ã ntiin wɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Ɔ̃sal-ãnguun wu amwɛn fool m'ɔ̃sal, oli mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel wu abɔɔ boo li ndɛ li nsia. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Tsam ngesɛ me m'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ yɛ. Mfam ndyam awa yɛ ãyal m'akwaal otsɛn o mɔ̃ mbueel.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Abeyeel me ndɔɔ a Yeso Mãsia wu ofi ke yam e David, wu ásiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi, onge b'eyɛɛn Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ebetsal mɛ̃. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Mɛ̃ ebemwɛn fool me ndɔɔ a Nsia yi Ngesɛ oyɔ, tiil k'akuru mɛ̃ me bwal onge edzuul. Kɛn Endɔɔ e Nziã, k'akoo m'okuru o lɔ wɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Obɔ otsɛn b'ebekuru mɛ̃ ɔ̃kwal onse fool olɔ lueel me ndɔɔ a b'ésueel Nziã, kwɛn bɔ hɛ̃ abɔɔ obvuul b'ofa ola Yeso Mãsia, ye lweel li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Oyɛɛn b'obvaan m'okiool bɔ bu: Ŋɛn bia-byɛ ekwi ye ndɛ, bia-byɛ hɛ̃ èkal y'elaã ye ndɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Okɛɛn bia-byɛ ekal y'osɛ-mwiĩ, bia-byɛ hɛ̃ èkal y'okwɛn ye ndɛ. Okɛɛn bia-byɛ ebee ndɛ, ndɛ àbee bia-byɛ hɛ̃. <verse eid="2TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Okɛɛn bia-byɛ k'eli y'okuru o nzuru wɛ, ndɛ oli wu obvaan m'okuru o nzuru, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ k'akoo k'abee nzuru a ndyam wɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃sal wu ekiool Mfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Oyɔ ndɔɔ yɛn ebvaan yɛ ayeel baal bueel yɔ ãlio mbueel. Ke nkwel a Nziã, yɛɛn bɔ ye mpɛn yueel wɛn abee obebel m'ãmbel m'ãndɔɔ. Obel obɔ k'oli y'otsɛn wɛ, bɔ ɔ̃sal kɛn obiil o baal b'ayoo bɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Sa mpɛn yi apal ke nkwel a Nziã onge mbuul wu ekiool ndɛ, onge ɔ̃sal wɛn k'akoo k'ayoo opfuru m'ɔ̃sal wu esi ndɛ wɛ. Kal ɔ̃sal wu atee Endɔɔ li otaa-taa m'emfa ki dzu. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Yɔɔl ɛ̃sam mi ngwel-a-ngwel, bvool mi ɛ̃siaan ãndɔɔ ã Nziã. Baal b'abewa ãnzuru m'ɛ̃sam omyɛ̃, abesyal kɛn osyal lala ye Nziã. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Ãyɛɛn ã baal obɔ ãbedza nzuru onge b'edza bwɔɔ li ye tsuɛɛn. Himene ye Filete ali onse baal obɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Bɔ asyel lala y'otaa-taa, bvool abal baal bibi onse okiool, ŋ'ebeyɛɛn bɔ ndiri b'ákwi-ákwi ámaasiool.<verse eid="2TI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãnkɔɔn m'étuu Nziã nkal a mɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Ke yam, ãnkɔɔn ãmpɛn m'étuu Nziã nkal a mɔ̃ k'ãbetsiɔ̃ wɛ. Ápwɛɛ ãyɛɛn mã nkal ãnkɔɔn omɔ̃: «Mfam oyɛɛ ba ndɛ», bvool ákel bubu: «Mbuul wu atuaal nkuũ a Mfam, asyal lala y'ãndɔɔ m'ãbi-ãbi.»<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Onse nzɔ a ɔ̃pfel, k'eli kɛn a y'asaan ba me ɔɔl ye ba me aadzã wɛ, eli hɛ̃ y'asaan ba me nkwii ye ba m'ɔ̃bwɛɛ. Ba me ɔɔl ye ba me aadzã b'abedza me bɔ m'ãtsoo m'ãpfuun, ba me nkwii ye ba m'ɔ̃bwɛɛ b'abedza me bɔ ãtsoo mbueel. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Mbuul wu okab nzuru y'ãtee m'ãbibi omɔ̃ oli onge saan li abedza me lɔ me tsoo e pfuun. Àsuul ndɛ wa ngel me ndɔɔ a Mfam a ndɛ. Ndɛ àkal ye bvɛɛ me ndɔɔ a Mfam, bvool àsuul ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi asa ɔ̃sal wueel wu ɔ̃bvɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃sal a Mfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Kal lala y'efua bvi onsam. Kɛn a bii ãndɔɔ mã dzu, y'okiool, ye dzii, y'opi, bvoo ye b'abuɛɛn Mfam m'ɔ̃kwal wa tsɛtsɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Bee ɛ̃tsuun mi owool-a-wool bvool myɛn otsɛn pyɛ, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ yɛɛ wɛn myɛ̃ ɛ̃beburu obel. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Ɔ̃sal a Mfam k'ebvaan abebel wɛ, ndɛ ebvaan akal ye nzal a baal bueel, akal mbuul wu okoo k'ayiool, bvool wu akuru ɔ̃kwal ke nkwel obi b'asa ndɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Ndɛ hɛ̃ ebvaan ayiool b'ali onse otaal ye ndɛ y'efyɛ lueel, bvool akal ye kaã lɛn owɛɛl kieel Nziã osi kwɛn bɔ akaal ɛ̃kwal me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛ otaa-taa. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ akieel okɔɔl onse ombuul o bɔ bvool apal onse abɛɛ b'ɔ̃pfu. Ndɛ wu ɔ̃pfu wu áwɔɔl bɔ me bwal, kwɛn bɔ asa m'edzii ndɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ãmpal m'ãkieel ãya m'ãtsoo ã ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Yɛɛ wɛn ãlio mã fool ãkieel ãyeya m'ãtsoo ã ntɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, baal akieel akal y'okob, ye pfuul o nzi, y'obɛɛl o ntwel, y'ondɛɛl o nzuru. Bɔ akieel asiaan Nziã, kieel k'akal ye lweel li aburu wɛ, kieel k'akal ye tuɛɛn wɛ, kieel k'akal ye bvɛɛ li eluɔ e Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Bɔ akieel akal nyiĩ a baal pyɛ, akieel akal y'ɔ̃kwal mpɛn, akieel akal ye kwee. Bɔ akieel aywɛn a okuru b'ɔ̃kwal, akieel akal ye kyal, bvool akieel akal ataal b'obvɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />Bɔ akieel atiɔ bakyɛ, akieel aluul m'efua, akieel m'ondɛɛl o nzuru b'ofoo bɔ mviil, akieel adzii efua ke mboo a Nziã. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Bɔ akieel asa onge bɛn bɔ abekuru ãnzuru m'ãndɔɔ ã Nziã, kwɛn ŋɛn bɔ abebee mpɛn a mɔ̃. Kal lala ye baal obɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Onse bɔ, eli ye b'abeyi m'ãnzɔ ã baal bvool abesa kwɛn akaal ba y'okwal abva m'abɛɛ a bɔ. Akaal obɔ b'aluul m'ãbi bvool bɛn kɛn awam onse okiool wɛ. Bɔ abeluɛɛn efua bvi ebei-ebi bvi emfa bwɛn emfa. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Bɔ abeyio kɛn oyio, kɛn a bɔ k'akoo m'oyɛɛ b'otaa-taa onkyam tsoo si ngelemɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn Dzanes ye Dzambes áli onse otaal ye Moyize, emfa kiki baal obɔ hɛ̃ ali onse otaal y'otaa-taa. Bɔ ali baal b'émeeyi ãyal nkel, bvool bɛn okiool ómoosuul. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Bɔ k'abeyi nkwel wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ owool-a-wool o bɔ okieel omɔɔn ke nkwel a baal bueel onge b'éli Dzanes ye Dzambes.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuru nzuru me m'eyio yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Me b'otal yɛ, yɛ mwɛn ngesɛ emfa ki ngyiool mɛ̃, ki nzuu mɛ̃, ki ngwɛɛ mɛ̃ k'asa ãndɔɔ, ki nkal mɛ̃ y'okiool, y'osɛ-mwiĩ, ye dzii, y'okuru b'ɔ̃kwal, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />ye mpal yi átueel mɛ̃, ye fool li émwɛn mɛ̃ k'Antioswe, k'Ikonihum, ke lisitele. Ãmpal ãmã mɛn mɛ̃ ke mwɛn wɛ! Kɛn onse mɔ̃ mbueel, Mfam obvuul mɛ̃. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Ke yam, mbuul wueel wu odzii k'akuru nzuru me Yeso Mãsia, akieel atuaal ndɛ mpal. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Kɛn abi y'anga-pfuru akieel anɔɔn kɛn a k'asa obi. Bɔ akieel adzeel bakyɛ, bvool akieel adzeel ãnzuru ã bam. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Me b'otal yɛ, kuru nzuru me m'eyio yɛ, me m'ekiool yɛ mam. Yɛ yɛɛ wu eyio yɛ mɔ̃ ola ndɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Fa obwee o yɛ, yɛ yɛɛ Ɛ̃nkaan mi ngel. Myɛ ɛ̃koo k'ɛ̃wa yɛ ãyal, kwɛn yɛ bɔɔ elaã me nkuul okiool me Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Ɛ̃nkaan mi ngel mvieel ɛ̃́yi me nkuul a Ɔ̃fel a Nziã, bvool ɛ̃li y'otsɛn me ndɔɔ yi ayiool baal, me ndɔɔ yi aswɛɛl baal ãtsam, me ndɔɔ yi aseel baal nkuul, bvool me ndɔɔ yi atee baal ãndɔɔ mã dzu. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul a Nziã akal ɔ̃koo bvool akal wu okoo onse ɔ̃yɛɛl wu asa ndɔɔ yueel yi ngesɛ.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Tee Endɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Ke nkwel a Nziã, ke nkwel a Yeso Mãsia, wu akieel atsiil ãndɔɔ ã b'amwiĩ-mwiĩ ye b'ákwi-ákwi, bvool wu akieel aya onge ɔ̃kwɛn, mɛ̃ ntam yɛ bam bubu: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />Tee Endɔɔ, tee lɔ me lio lueel, ekal me lio li ngesɛ, ekal me lio li ebi-ebi. Seel ãndɔɔ mɛn k'ãli dzu wɛ, wa mbyel bvool wɛɛl baal. Yiool ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ y'osɛ-mwiĩ bueel. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, lio ekieel eya lɛn baal bakyɛ kieel k'abedzii k'ayoo Endɔɔ li ɔ̃nsensal wɛ. Kɛn a bɔ akieel aluɛɛn ãtsam ã bam. Bɔ akieel ata atee bam bibi mbel, b'aliaal bɔ m'eli bɔ ye nzal a k'ayoo mɔ̃. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Bɔ kieel abee k'ayoo ãtee mã taa-taa bvool akieel adzii bam k'ayoo esesam bvi mfya. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Me b'otal yɛ, m'ãndɔɔ mbueel, bee enduul osa, kuru ɔ̃kwal onse ãmpal, tsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ, sa ɔ̃sal a yɛ ngesɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, lio emeekoo li awa mɛ̃ elaã e mɛ̃ onge kab ola Nziã. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Mɛ̃ nzwaan mvel yi ngesɛ, mɛ̃ nsɛɛl ntiin a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke ngyɔɔl okiool wɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Meba ŋã, ebva-kab ki awa mbuul wu obvel mpɛn me mvel ekiaal mɛ̃. Ebva-kab okyɛ, Mfam wu ntwel wa dzu, akieel awa mɛ̃ kyɛ me tsoo olɔ. Kɛn a wu ekieel ewa ndɛ kyɛ ke kɛn a mɛ̃, ndɛ hɛ̃ kieel awa kyɛ me baal bɛn ye dzii lueel, abekiaal lio li ekieel eya ndɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãyɛɛn ã Pool mã ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Olɔ yɛɛ k'aya ola mɛ̃ bam tswa-tswa. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Demas oyiri mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a nzal a eluɔ bvi ɔ̃kiri wu, bu ayɛn Tesalonik. Kelesense oyɛn Ngalati, Tite oyɛn Dalemati. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Wu oli ye mɛ̃ ŋã kɛn a Luk ndyam sii. Wal Maak, ya ye ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli y'ɔ̃bvɛn bibi ola mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a ɔ̃sal. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Mɛ̃ ntam Titswik Efedze. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Ŋ'èya yɛ, biri mɛ̃ ekɔ ki abendɔɔl ke ywel a kikyɛ ki esiil mɛ̃ ke Telohas ola Kaapos. Wal ɛ̃nkaan hɛ̃, bvel-bvel mi abedzii m'odzii. <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alekesandele wu ɔ̃tswel dzuul osi mɛ̃ obi bibi. Mfam kieel abveel ndɛ m'ãbvaan me b'esi ndɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Yɛ hɛ̃, kal y'onkyab ye ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ obee ãyɛɛn ã bee bam kiningi. <verse eid="2TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Ŋ'éketsuun mɛ̃ li ɛ̃kwel ke mbal, mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ k'áli ye mɛ̃ wɛ, baal bueel áyiri mɛ̃. Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã abee b'esi bɔ obɔ osiɔɔl. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Kɛn a Mfam wu owueel a mɛ̃ bvool wu osi kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal ye waan. M'emfa okyɛ, mɛ̃ nkoo k'etsal Nsia a ndɛ, bvool nsi kwɛn baal bueel bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ ayoo yɔ. Ndɛ hɛ̃ obvuul mɛ̃ m'ɔ̃nywã wu ebob. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Mfam kieel abvuul mɛ̃ m'obi bueel, ndɛ kieel abvuul mɛ̃ hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ Okwɛn o ndɛ bo ywel. Yɔɔl kwɛn alweel nkuũ a ndɛ ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. Amɛn!<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio wa ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Mɛ̃ mbio Pilisile y'Akilas, ye yam li Onesifɔɔl. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Elasite osiil ke Kolinte, mɛ̃ nsiil Tolefime y'ãluu ke Milet. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Olɔ yɛɛ k'aya ye k'ekoo lio e mfyɛ. Ehubulos, ye Pudens, ye Linus, ye Kelodia, y'andoo a dzii bueel abio byɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam akal y'ɔ̃fel a yɛ! Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã asio byɛ nyiĩ.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>